  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:079196cb63cbb1d463ec3aac6364070e339053a899f97de2af875beea106b52a",
      "request_id": "079196cb63cbb1d463ec3aac6364070e339053a899f97de2af875beea106b52a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b3a50c417bfe6a64dd4b9d5132669ab9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2026 年 10 月 26 日，巴塞尔。九千名观众起立，掌声响了三分多钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cf59fd5352cfa7055ee3cfdc52817c516b11ff92b24757cabb78d90866428e8b",
      "words_sha256": "04f9bf08c01a71b0375837e3a316aee8b601982a2e22def00d37fcf9851c7840"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0ea45041fac038fd4aeffab8e0d2a4909d0e7b57ebe3f2bf3998c56b0c7ed0b6",
      "request_id": "0ea45041fac038fd4aeffab8e0d2a4909d0e7b57ebe3f2bf3998c56b0c7ed0b6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d02f5bb0dbfd95f9f8a532025542cb13",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年 12 月，他宣布退役时写道：每本书都需要一个结局。瑞士人把这个结局，写成了一场庆典。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6eff6c2bd49d019c019db8a12cebe984c4c826494f6519f0d0746ebd2645d32f",
      "words_sha256": "43a38b60eeda19b63dc90d5eeb240402fb26c7a52d0101ccd0e5547eeeb8413e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1b370fc4eb3c43cc74da0e5d020697e46bdced9413d49dcf32f610a27f8d4fd3",
      "request_id": "1b370fc4eb3c43cc74da0e5d020697e46bdced9413d49dcf32f610a27f8d4fd3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ee1ed25e8f6bac8e23b0ba2797417613",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "轮到他自己致辞。他先谢了布伦瓦尔德——这站比赛，他打了十九届。然后，他讲了一句让全场大笑的话。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4c01eaeac6fb7d593b9d2a11609890e78f48ead9cd7512ce528c18eca567b05e",
      "words_sha256": "cdc057d695573b1b2be8c308bd2324ad81d86a0f8b66d58d28664ec2cf4440c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:415abb6e6aeb32b0f3405470f514c0deccbad22c60aa6db6c008055851952af6",
      "request_id": "415abb6e6aeb32b0f3405470f514c0deccbad22c60aa6db6c008055851952af6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d3c77d3107c30a88201f74a9b8e78bc2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三次决赛，三次掀翻世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "87db35fb379aa61e0269e5eb1df3cc1cb36875c338bafc754ecba812b6c48ba3",
      "words_sha256": "f1e392c756eecce25becfa6fc4334a1c75e3a7316ae35fad521f29b4491646c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:533b7869d1151c1af572ed384b2582e6fe4f426a3266c21eed65cb31e6ef75ad",
      "request_id": "533b7869d1151c1af572ed384b2582e6fe4f426a3266c21eed65cb31e6ef75ad",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b29e6225cdf680c0130d097d997422bf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而在巴塞尔当地 10 月 27 日晚，他还要走进这座球场，打职业生涯的最后一场比赛——或者，还不止一场。这一战，你希望他赢吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fd04110ff004d8bbad651182c4ff2a4684b4b5e89aa3ebb7a25150203bb56bb0",
      "words_sha256": "74d479f1e16d67c65feebb49713dd5eba326ddf747a6254e806e08db7c1efb6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:568536abf706af5783719f94e499b7fc3ce5e57f80961de5de0ea58b902311fc",
      "request_id": "568536abf706af5783719f94e499b7fc3ce5e57f80961de5de0ea58b902311fc",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "195d1a22fca16ff7df0ee335edb06b2d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后播出的，是他父母的视频。镜头扫过，瓦林卡低下了头。全场最吵的一夜，在那一刻最安静。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "846b1a7f15f2d19d0d1ac2acd7b14230d31fb5f4fc9f6de7e015120793757cc2",
      "words_sha256": "0995c6cbf152e2a34021e51bbc144632970d5f312db037e4eadc0905893aebf3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5f6ae1290ed4db49e399c706c4a26ebea668cf64454888a82b2adc46d4a56315",
      "request_id": "5f6ae1290ed4db49e399c706c4a26ebea668cf64454888a82b2adc46d4a56315",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ceca6384ad44c0a06e86ae370b48941a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "试过，败过，没关系。再试，再败，败得更好。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "748d6c6669b7c2e26f55224f5e71f53ea421e4c8b0e2de12c44cc6a7c9eed42a",
      "words_sha256": "fa9c82383ad8e48ba7a31e9d54acec1cc916ad3942f599c7d58b1bc8a9454273"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:85a29de8dca0d94a7368a1a3560f8da42067bd1484c29857409ba150b52d16d9",
      "request_id": "85a29de8dca0d94a7368a1a3560f8da42067bd1484c29857409ba150b52d16d9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e8069aa5215a06f313bbd25c1dd07a96",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后，他绕场一周。手机灯光亮起来，像给他点了一场星海。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3609a3690b1805be9deb5c8fdb7404a9bf8007380c6a7e7b190da468bbd7e738",
      "words_sha256": "e9c3b0b85dfea3750cd3198f0f14977639c9bdf3bd99a2ba27bd1bca885b55f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9a2e252d921e0891e0922a25fdb2ca2f9dd6b25d33ee9e467d46fd84a8412499",
      "request_id": "9a2e252d921e0891e0922a25fdb2ca2f9dd6b25d33ee9e467d46fd84a8412499",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c4cf40079b2431cf9fb270c976147737",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一个出现的，是费德勒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6129fd0c98183aae3f8d9291f74ed5274fb6911761872cfa82e0868cbc899c69",
      "words_sha256": "1c7f85d3105132bdf4eb754707b0af50e5b1a85929d4f96c3ddbe34c5a3da43b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a151300787b948d033f6826982f299f1a80c149d931628c837508507f132d8bf",
      "request_id": "a151300787b948d033f6826982f299f1a80c149d931628c837508507f132d8bf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1337498114ccfb7b42d7648fdc939aa5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一个从没在这座球场拿过冠军的人，这一夜是全场的主角。这一夜没有比赛——这是瑞士网球，为斯坦·瓦林卡办的告别仪式。布伦瓦尔德送了他一颗金色的网球，叫他网球界的史泰龙。而这里，也是他职业生涯的最后一站。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "057240c731fb71e2546d5b57fa72300b5dd18e9d10a13aefbf2c52ce9d7a280d",
      "words_sha256": "ac4151de69f1f745a021eaeb43c7549c5a699d40db573d240ea1fe10c0fd2e13"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:aaa026ccb7b7f6c884470845451155d71378788f310b8d27095b72b2be5c7dfa",
      "request_id": "aaa026ccb7b7f6c884470845451155d71378788f310b8d27095b72b2be5c7dfa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "420311faa0e4c755114d31535b8ba7ae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "主持人端来一盘爆米花。他笑着选了爆米花，没选香蕉，坐下来，看大屏幕上放自己的二十四年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "995ca3cdf62dfbede59a23d1a346b1158d9fd268bc47f72e7cc54fa3a95e260f",
      "words_sha256": "0714865daedb5e3de7be16441af894175c661fd4c49ed19403bc2b7ab2608464"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ded5298dc3a7ec4848aa030d4824ee2fb1eada0a6d9b32b7cce6727e58daac30",
      "words_sha256": "bb371455942874977b3cf9931ffff5c7dc8edb8ad37adc407760e65dfcb2a596"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d16dc319e9abaded792ea281467fe90db0e644c8ca2a39b7361c3d7d9a9f6f6f",
      "request_id": "d16dc319e9abaded792ea281467fe90db0e644c8ca2a39b7361c3d7d9a9f6f6f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c5a94137ce3fe85c5220755154168ea5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "和费德勒同为瑞士人，是『另一个瑞士人』，二十八岁才第一次打进年终前十。三次大满贯决赛，对面站的全是世界第一，他全赢了。2017 年第四次决赛，输给纳达尔。之后他膝盖连做两次手术，排名跌到第二百六十三位——他又爬回来，打到了四十一岁。他的左臂上纹着一句话：再试，再败，败得更好。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f1b98c29f971c37eb284da2d2cf806d0a1fa1f8c6927729c21eada751487ae0f",
      "words_sha256": "58d5c2e0a719552e5b59aadddc14486320430eaad1ef0293794966eac33cd343"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e437cdaa86c81e52f35848213c1191e4008a971bddf6854872c1b66f06b70ef2",
      "request_id": "e437cdaa86c81e52f35848213c1191e4008a971bddf6854872c1b66f06b70ef2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c63653f942a209f2ae672dc15a2b86c2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "穆雷、威兰德、纳芙拉蒂洛娃、蒙菲尔斯依次出现，德约科维奇干脆就坐在观众席里。麦肯罗的致辞，只有一句最戳人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bcf3459501a4e16defb0388cde9128fd90508d7289d8397b8c7f7d62d5eefc37",
      "words_sha256": "26e5241d2be79db743954a661616950033318ea65a706d4ef4fe11b5c45612ae"
    },
